        2. Enable Google sign-in provider
        3. Click "Web SDK configuration" to find your Web client ID
        4. It looks like: 418342184988-xxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
        5. Also add your SHA-1 fingerprint in Firebase Console > Project Settings > Your apps

        If you don't set this up:
        - Google Sign-In button will be hidden (not shown to users)
        - Email/Password and Guest login will still work perfectly
    -->
